cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: Vedaksha
abstract: >-
  Clean-room Rust ephemeris and Vedic astrology engine. Computes planetary
  positions from VSOP87/ELP2000/MPP02 series and JPL DE440s SPK kernels, and
  derives Vedic astrology charts (panchanga, varga, bala, dasha) as a
  queryable property graph. Validated against a 24,350-row JPL Horizons
  fixture at 0.096 arcsecond mean residual over 1900 to 2025.
type: software
